  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/8f/Chili_Poppers.png/revision/latest?cb=20240212130039\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Chili poppers\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chili poppers\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"108\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Chili poppers</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Product</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 98</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1 to 406</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  40 min</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 48</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Deep Fryer</span><span title=\"Deep fryer\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/deep-fryer-33952\" title=\"Deep Fryer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Deep Fryer\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"52\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Default: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 113</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">★★★</a> </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">34 min</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Chili poppers</b> are a <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">product</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 98.\n</p><p>Like all <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, it is stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Making chili poppers</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/05/Deep_Fryer.png/revision/latest?cb=20250926002632\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Deep Fryer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Deep Fryer\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"144\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Deep Fryer</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Chili poppers are made in the <a href=\"/wiki/deep-fryer-33952\" title=\"Deep Fryer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Deep Fryer</a>.\n</p><p>To make chili poppers, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/chili-pepper-2235\" title=\"Chili Pepper\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chili Pepper\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/wheat-2062\" title=\"Wheat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Wheat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/bacon-2267\" title=\"Bacon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bacon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/cheese-2318\" title=\"Cheese\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cheese\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x3</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x3</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 40 minutes to make one serving, and 34 minutes in a fully <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mastered</a> machine. Each serving gives players 48 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Selling chili poppers</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/09/Roadside_Shop.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028143054\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Roadside shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Roadside shop</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>Chili poppers can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 4,068 <span>Coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Coin\"><img alt=\"Coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> for 10 servings.</li>\n<li>Buying the ingredients required to make chili poppers costs 383 <span>Coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Coin\"><img alt=\"Coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Boat orders</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Riverboat.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712182459\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Riverboat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Riverboat</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> orders ask for 1 to 2 chili poppers per crate, up to a total of 6 per boat.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Keep plenty of bacon in stock.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-deep-fryer-products-33991\" title=\"Category:Deep Fryer Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Deep Fryer Products</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/bacon-fries-33967\" title=\"Bacon Fries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bacon Fries\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/chili-poppers-33969\" title=\"Chili Poppers\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chili Poppers\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"54\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/falafel-35386\" title=\"Falafel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Falafel\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/fried-candy-bar-34687\" title=\"Fried Candy Bar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fried Candy Bar\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/hand-pies-33968\" title=\"Hand Pies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Hand Pies\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/samosa-35387\" title=\"Samosa\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Samosa\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Products</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831074000\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.102 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 998/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5880/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 881/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936182/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   60.969      1 -total\n 72.87%   44.427      1 Template:Infobox\n 31.02%   18.915      9 Template:Infoicon\n 17.96%   10.950      1 Template:Navigation\n  9.84%    6.001      1 Template:DeepFryerMenu\n  2.51%    1.531      1 Template:Languages\n  2.08%    1.270      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  1.98%    1.210      4 Template:Clr\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:33969-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260831074000 and revision id 110207. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
