  "wikitext": "\n{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Chili Poppers.png|200px|left|Chili poppers]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |level = 98|price = 1 to 406|time = 40 min|xp = 48|source = {{Infoicon|deepfr|bigger|link=Deep Fryer}}|base = 113|dia = 3|time3 = 34 min|title = [[Products|Product]]}}\n'''Chili poppers''' are a [[Products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 98.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making chili poppers'''===\n[[File:Deep Fryer.png|150px|left|Deep Fryer]]\nChili poppers are made in the [[Deep Fryer]].\n\nTo make chili poppers, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Chili Pepper.png|75px|Chili Pepper|link=Chili Pepper]]\n|[[File:Wheat.png|75px|Wheat|link=Wheat]]\n|[[File:Bacon.png|75px|Bacon|link=Bacon]]\n|[[File:Cheese.png|75px|Cheese|link=Cheese]]\n|-\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 40 minutes to make one serving, and 34 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] machine. Each serving gives players 48 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling chili poppers'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n* Chili poppers can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 4,068 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 servings.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make chili poppers costs 383 {{Infoicon|Coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 to 2 chili poppers per crate, up to a total of 6 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n* Keep plenty of bacon in stock.\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Chilihäppchen\n|es = Chiles fritos\n|fr = Poivrons au Chili\n|it = Peperoncini ripieni\n|nl = Gefrituurde Chilipepers\n|no = Chilipoppers\n|ru = Перец чили в кляре\n|zh = Chili Poppers\n}}\n[[pt-br:Pimenta recheada]]\n\n[[Category:Deep Fryer Products]]\n[[Category:Chili Pepper Products]]\n[[Category:Wheat Products]]\n[[Category:Bacon Products]]\n[[Category:Cheese Products]]",
